---
layout: layout.njk
permalink: /timeline/
title: Timeline
description: Every dated thing I’ve built, by year, with its sourced events.
---
<section class="intro">
  <h1>Timeline</h1>
  <p class="lede">Each bar runs from a thing’s first dated year to its last, or to now for things still active. Dots are sourced history events. Bars are decisions; dots are evidence.</p>
  <p class="legend">
    {% for s in site.statuses %}<span class="status status-{{ s.status }}">{{ s.label }}</span> {% endfor %}
    <span class="muted">· dots: launch, milestone, retirement, archive, development</span>
  </p>
</section>
<div class="timeline-scroll" tabindex="0" aria-label="Timeline, scrolls sideways">
  {{ site.timeline | timeline | safe }}
</div>
<div class="tooltip" role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden></div>
{% if site.timeline.undated | length %}
<section class="undated">
  <h2>Not yet dated</h2>
  <p class="muted">These things have no sourced start date or event yet.</p>
  <p>{% for thing in site.timeline.undated %}<a class="tag" href="{{ thing.page }}">{{ thing.title }}</a> {% endfor %}</p>
</section>
{% endif %}
<script src="{{ assets.timeline }}" defer></script>
